claim.claim-text:
providing a surgical needle comprising an elongate body having a tissue-penetrating end and a suture attachment end;
applying a base coating to a surface of the surgical needle, the base coating composition comprising a vinyl functionalized organopolysiloxane and a hydrofluoroether solvent; and
applying a top coating formed from a top coating composition comprising a polydimethylsiloxane and a hydrofluoroether solvent.
